---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
---

<Layout
  title="About us"
  description="Cluetune is a free guess-the-song game in the browser. No account, no app — a Songless-style daily plus unlimited rounds."
  schema={{
    "@type": "AboutPage",
    "@id": `${SITE.url}/about#about`,
    url: `${SITE.url}/about`,
    name: "About Cluetune",
    description: "Cluetune is a free guess-the-song game in the browser.",
  }}
>
  <article class="page-shell py-8 sm:py-16">
    <header class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-3">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1 class="text-display-xl text-ink">Cluetune is a website where you guess the song.</h1>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body">
        A one-second clip, six tries, and no login. Built for people who searched for Songless,
        Guessable, or any game where you guess the song from a fragment of audio.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-12 flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-5 text-body-md text-body">
      <p>
        Cluetune runs entirely in your browser at {SITE.domain}. The daily puzzle is the same clip
        for everyone and resets at midnight where you are. When that one is done,{" "}
        <a href="/unlimited" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">Unlimited</a> keeps the
        same ladder going — that is how you play more than once, or play a Songless unlimited
        session, without waiting for tomorrow.
      </p>
      <p>
        Other modes sit next to it:{" "}
        <a href="/sped-up" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">Sped-Up</a> at 1.35×,{" "}
        <a href="/lyrics" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">Lyrics Guess</a> if you
        know the words better than the intro, and{" "}
        <a href="/gauntlet" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">Genre Gauntlet</a> for
        five rounds in one scene.
      </p>
      <p>
        There is no company login wall and no native app. Stats stay on your device. Audio is
        streamed from the rights holders’ own preview services; Cluetune does not host or re-serve
        files. Read the{" "}
        <a href="/how-to-play" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">rules</a>, the{" "}
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">privacy policy</a>, or{" "}
        <a href="/contact" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Play today’s daily</a>
      <a href="/unlimited" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Unlimited</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
